  <History Date="02-10-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="03-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed prism 2 locate and function order in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="03-11-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Renamed Gobo 1 Rot to Gobo 2 Rot and revised Gobo func controls and conditionals accordingly (error in manual)" />
  <History Date="17-02-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="22-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Renamed lamp on and lamp off macros for compatibility with factory macros in response to bug report." />
  <History Date="24-05-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added gobo swatches (originals are very poor quality)" />
  <History Date="02-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised prism rot ranges and wheel directions in line with latest charts in response to customer feedback." />
  <History Date="02-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Minor revisions to gobo 1 and prism ranges in line with latest charts.  Added gobo names." />
